WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:14.214
A secret goes in the way it always did

2
00:00:14.214 --> 00:00:23.379
Only names in the list, the value on demand

3
00:00:23.379 --> 00:00:40.671
Her son sees what she chose to share

4
00:00:40.671 --> 00:00:54.693
A value moved to another row does not open

5
00:00:54.693 --> 00:01:08.600
Older secrets moved over on their own
